marker lines and is replaced, not added to, when it is pasted again (`upsertShareBlock`, from the presenter's
`appendLine` and its release-notes marker); a listing title that is one line of at most 200 characters; a poster
image that links to the watch page, with the link in text beneath it. scripts/lib/path-safe.mjs states the
presenter's file-safety idea (a read or a write only inside the folder it was named against, never through a
